# Machine-specific symlink created by catkin_init_workspace; regenerated
# inside the image by the Dockerfile instead of being copied in, since a
# broken symlink in the build context makes Docker Desktop's context
# transfer fail outright on Windows hosts.
src/CMakeLists.txt

# Real-camera driver, not used by the Gazebo sim. Needs the Intel
# RealSense SDK and ddynamic_reconfigure, neither of which the sim
# image carries; only relevant when building on the real TX2 robot.
src/realsense-ros
